# Site Configuration

Copy this file to `site-config.md` (gitignored) and fill in your details.

## Target Site

- Base URL: https://your-site.example.com
- Login URL: https://your-site.example.com/login

## Credentials

- Email: user@example.com
- Password: your-password

## Login Redirect Behaviour

Redirecting to /login is NOT a bug at the start of a session — unauthenticated visits always
redirect. Log in and continue testing.

It IS a bug if you were already authenticated and navigating between pages, then get
unexpectedly redirected to login.

## Known Routes

Add known routes here to help verify navigation succeeded after clicking links:

- Dashboard: /dashboard
- Settings: /settings
